flowchart TD
  A[Change committed to feature branch] --> B[Merge to dev]
  B --> C[Required checks complete]
  C -->|pass| D[Render + preview delivery]
  C -->|fail| R1[Required check failure]
  R1 --> T1[Resolve check failure]
  D --> E{Web/Preview outcome}
  E -->|Web healthy| F[Validate SHA + QA]
  E -->|Web unhealthy| R2[Render deployment failure]
  R2 --> T2[Rollback to previous deployment / fix root cause]
  F --> G{Android classifier}
  G -->|OTA_SAFE| H[OTA publish]
  G -->|NATIVE_REQUIRED| T3[Queue controlled native build]
  G -->|UNSUPPORTED/MISMATCH| R3[Gate failure, no publish]
  G -->|ERROR| R4[Evidence/command failure]
  H --> I[Install QA]
  T3 --> I2[Release-specific native follow-up]
  I --> J{iOS native required?}
  J -->|yes| K[iOS build + TestFlight]
  J -->|no| Q1[No iOS change]
  K --> R5[TestFlight processing]
  R5 -->|processing| T4[Track and wait]
  R5 -->|ready| L[Installer QA]
  R3 --> S1[Owner triage and re-run after remediation]
  R4 --> S2[Owner review + root-cause fix]
  I2 --> M{Owner approval}
  L --> M
  Q1 --> M
  M -->|approved| N[Production evaluation or next delivery]
  M -->|blocked| O[Pause + owner communication]
  N --> P((Owner/Team closed-loop evidence))
